ible:outline-ring"><span class="sr-only">We can fix everything.</span><span aria-hidden="true">We can fix every<span data-typing="0"><span></span><span class="typed-caret" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></span></a></h2><p class="mt-6 max-w-[35.5rem] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-text-secondary [text-wrap:pretty] ">Linux used to be a chore to setup, difficult to debug, and full of confusing upfront choices. Omarchy solves all of it with a lightning fast installation, agents that debug all issues, and fantastic defaults that give you a fully functioning system that looks amazing out of the box.</p><p class="mt-5 max-w-[35.5rem] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-text-secondary [text-wrap:pretty] ">Oma is for omakase, chef&#x27;s choice: we pick the tools and tune the details, so you can get straight to work. But this is your computer. You&#x27;re free to change everything.</p><p class="mt-5 max-w-[35.5rem] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-text-secondary [text-wrap:pretty]">Behind it all is the<!-- --> <a href="/doctrine/" class="underline decoration-border-strong underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-current">Omarchy Doctrine</a>: ten principles for uniting the nerds, welcoming the agents, and building the perfect computer. We&#x27;re not there yet, but<!-- --> <a href="https://wecanfixeverything.com/" class="underline decoration-border-strong underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-current">we can fix everything now.</a></p></div><div class="lg:justify-self-end lg:self-center lg:[&amp;&gt;figure]:-mt-[3px]"><figure class="group relative max-w-md border border-border-subtle bg-surface p-5 transition-colors duration-150 ease-out hover:border-border-strong lg:p-7 has-[a:focus-visible]:outline-2 has-[a:focus-visible]:outline-offset-2 has-[a:focus-visible]:outline-ring"><div aria-hidden="true" class="h-10 font-sans text-6xl leading-none font-bold text-brand">“</div><blockquote cite="https://youtu.be/NYFGCESmikA?t=7104" class="font-sans text-xl leading-snug font-medium text-t