-w-xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-text sm:text-[1.75rem]"><a href="/#developers" class="text-inherit no-underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-ring">Developed by developers for developers</a></h2><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-text-secondary [text-wrap:pretty]">The tools you know, set up to work together. Bring your projects, choose your favorites, and get straight to building.</p></div></div><div class="mt-6 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3 lg:mt-10 lg:gap-8"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col border-t border-border-strong pt-4"><h3 class="text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-text">Your editor, integrated</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-text-secondary [text-wrap:pretty]">Neovim is the default, with VSCode, Cursor, Zed, Sublime Text, Helix, Vim, and Emacs ready to install. Pick your favorite and make it the system-wide default.</p><a href="/manual/development-tools/#alternative-editors" class="mt-auto inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-2 self-start pt-4 text-sm font-medium text-text underline-offset-4 hover:text-brand focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-ring [&amp;:hover_span]:decoration-current"><span class="underline decoration-current">Choose your editor</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="size-5 shrink-0"><path d="M14 5.75L20.25 12L14 18.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square"></path><path d="M19.5 12H3.75" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square"></path></svg></a></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col border-t border-border-strong pt-4"><h3 class="text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-text">Your stack, ready to go</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-text-secondary [text-wrap:pretty]">Install Ruby on Rails, Laravel, Node.js, and a long list of other development environments from the Omarchy menu. Mise handles language versions, so each project can use what it needs.</p><a href="/manual/development-tools/#environment" class="mt-auto inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-2 self-start pt-4 text-sm font-medium text-text underline-offset-4 hover:text-brand focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-ring [&amp;:hover_span]:decoration-current"><span class="underline decoration-current">Set up your stack</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="size-5 shrink-0"><path d="M14 5.75L20.25 12L14 18.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square"></path><path d="M19.5 12H3.75" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square"></path></svg></a></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col border-t border-border-strong pt-4"><h3 class="text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-text">Four terminals, one choice</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-text-secondary [text-wrap:pretty]">Foot is the fast, lightweight default. Prefer Alacritty, Ghostty, or Kitty? All four are integrated, and switching your default keeps the same keyboard shortcuts working.</p><a href="/manual/terminal/" class="mt-auto inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-2 self-start pt-4 text-sm font-medium text-text underline-offset-4 hover:text-brand focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-ring [&amp;:hover_span]:decoration-current"><span class="underline decoration-current">Pick your terminal</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="size-5 shrink-0"><path d="M14 5.75L20.25 12L14 18.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square"></path><path d="M19.5 12H3.75" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square"></path></svg></a></div></div><p class="mt-10 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">Also available:<!-- --> <span><a href="/manual/tuis/#herdr" class="whitespace-nowrap underline decoration-border-strong underline-offset-4 hover:text-brand hover:decoration-current focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-ring">Herdr</a></span><span>, <a href="/manual/terminal/#tmux" class="whitespace-nowrap underline decoration-border-strong underline-offset-4 hover:text-brand hover:decoration-current focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-ring">Tmux</a></span><span>, <a href="/manual/development-tools/#docker" class="whitespace-nowrap underline decoration-border-strong underline-offset-4 hover:text-brand hover:decoration-current focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-ring">Docker</a></span><span>, <a href="/manual/tuis/#lazygit" class="whitespace-nowrap underline decoration-border-strong underline-offset-4 hover:text-brand hover:decoration-current focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-ring">Lazygit</a></span><span>, and <a href="/manual/shell-tools/" class="whitespace-nowrap underline decoration-border-strong underline-offset-4 hover:text-brand hover:decoration-current focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-ring">the best shell tools</a></span>.</p></div></section><section id="gaming" class="border-t border-border-subtle"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 lg:py-24 sm:px-6"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4"><div class="max-w-xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-text sm:text-[1.75rem]"><a href="/#gaming" class="text-inherit no-underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-ring">All work and all play is all good</a></h2><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-text-secondary [text-wrap:pretty]">Omarchy comes ready for Steam, RetroArch, and a whole world of gaming. Graphics drivers and configuration, including NVIDIA on supported hardware, are sorted during installation.</p></div><div class="hidden shr